cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite both the concept DOI (all versions) and the exact version DOI below."
title: "Zar-Manah HELIOS: Dual-Scale Space Weather Intelligence Coupling Tactical Conformal Nowcasting (1-6h) and Planetary CME Shock Transit (24-72h) across Solar Cycles 23-25"
abstract: >-
  HELIOS 2.0 is an open, locally executable four-tier space weather intelligence
  architecture. It couples de-projected 3D CME kinematics and coronal magnetic
  proxies (HELIOS-CHIRALITY-APEX, HELIOS-STORM-APEX), a dynamic MoK + GBDT shock
  transit ensemble (HELIOS-Transit), and calibrated conformal nowcasting of the
  ring current at L1 (HELIOS-Tactical). All models are evaluated out-of-distribution
  on Solar Cycle 25 and released with reproducible artifacts, checksums, and a
  command-line inference client.
